# Battle against Deoxys (the alien mythical Pokémon): a B-flat-minor signal from far off, synths in threes against the
# four of the bar, and a chord a tritone away that does not belong. Original composition for this game.
title Battle! Deoxys
tempo 184
meter 4/4
lowhptempo 1.07
reverb 0.28

track lead sawlead lowhp=square vol=0.84 pan=0 rev=0.24
  r1 | o5 a8. o6 c8. e-8 f8. e-8. c8 |
  L o5 b-8. f8. b-8 o6 d-4 e-8 d-8 | o6 f8. e-8. d-8 o5 b-4 a-4 | o5 g-8. b-8. o6 d-8 e-4 d-8 o5 b-8 | o5 a4. o6 c8 e-4 o5 a4 |
